LIBRARY ClrPalet INITINSTANCE
DESCRIPTION 'Named Color Palette sample object class'
PROTMODE
DATA MULTIPLE NONSHARED LOADONCALL
EXPORTS
   ColorPaletteCClassData
   ColorPaletteClassData
   ColorPaletteNewClass
   M_ColorPaletteCClassData
   M_ColorPaletteClassData
   M_ColorPaletteNewClass
   StarColorPaletteCClassData
   StarColorPaletteClassData
   StarColorPaletteNewClass
;  M_StarColorPalette* are NOT emitted by the modern SOM compiler either -
;  clrstar.idl declares no metaclass, exactly as the original noted:
;  "SOM didn't give us a metaclass".
   SOMInitModule

; Parent-class symbols consumed from wpconfig.dll at load time are
; declared as IMPORTS by Makefile.wat (WPSIMP), so they are not listed here.
